---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import headshot from "../../../assets/img/headshot.png";
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20">
  <p class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">About</p>

  <div class="mt-6 grid items-start gap-10 md:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr]">
    <Image
      src={headshot}
      alt="Charlie Gallagher"
      width={448}
      class="aspect-[4/5] w-40 rounded-lg border border-line object-cover md:w-full"
    />

    <div class="space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <p>
        I'm a final-year software student at TUS and an innovation engineer at
        <span class="text-fg">Hewlett Packard Enterprise</span>, where I build
        AI agents and the cloud tooling around them. I started at HPE as an
        intern in January 2026 and I'm joining full-time after I graduate.
      </p>
      <p>
        The part I enjoy most is making AI tools that people can actually rely
        on. My final-year project looks at the same problem from the safety
        side.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of that I chair the
        <span class="text-fg">RUN-EU Student Council</span>, representing
        students from nine European universities.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/about"
        class="inline-block pt-2 text-base text-fg transition-colors hover:text-primary"
      >
        More about me &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
